    Nakov, S. and Kolev, V. et al., 2013. Fundamentals of Computer
    Programming with C#. Sofia. [ebook] Available at:
    <https://www.introprogramming.info/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Books/CSharpEn/Fundamentals-of-Computer-Programming-with-CSharp-Nakov-eBook-v2013.pdf>
    [Accessed 9 September 2026].

    The IIE, 2026. Programming 3A [PROG7311 Module Manual].
    The Independent Institute of Education: Unpublished.

