    [Accessed 20 April 2026].

    W3Schools, 2025c. JavaScript Fetch API. [online] Available at:
    <https://www.w3schools.com/js/js_api_fetch.asp>
    [Accessed 20 April 2026].

    W3Schools, 2025d. Razor C# Logic. [online] Available at:
